# Known-good checksum baseline for everything under public/ — most of it frozen
# legacy content carried forward unchanged, plus any build-adjacent file (e.g.
# a small script served straight to the browser) that has to live there too.
#
# tests/build/public-passthrough.test.ts asserts every entry here matches
# the current file in public/. Entries are removed deliberately, one at a
# time, as each page migrates out of public/ into a real Astro route in a
# later slice — a removed line here is an intentional act of that
# migration, not drift. Do not edit a hash to make a failing test pass;
# regenerate it only when the corresponding public/ file is deliberately
# replaced by the maintainer.
#
# Format: <sha256>  <path relative to public/, forward slashes>, sorted by path.

